  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">README Status = Complete with Completed Date + changelog; all spec §Success Criteria 1–10 checked or deferred-with-rationale.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/test-diet` ran; `notes/test-diet-report.md` exists and the wrap-up PR cites it.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">All four documented follow-ups are reconciled via `/project-defer-issue-tracking` to BOTH `notes/defer-issues.md` AND GitHub Issues (no notes-only entry).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`notes/lessons-learned.md` is written; this project's row in `projects/INDEX.md` is updated to Complete.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Every TASK-INDEX row is ✅ (or explicitly deferred/dropped with rationale); `current-task.md` is reset to "none".</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Final gate. No new BFF surface authored → no publish-size gate here (051 owns the release NFR). Reference spec §Success Criteria + CLAUDE.md §7 project-close test-diet gate. The four documented follow-ups are design-time deferrals (spec §Unresolved Questions), not new discoveries — reconcile them honestly. Completion summary appended here when done.</notes>

